    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>You move in the pauses no one else hears.</em></p><p>You gain a subtle control over the tempo of danger:</p><ul><li>You gain a <strong>+1 bonus to initiative</strong>.</li><li>When you are not surprised, the first attack made against you each combat is made with <strong>disadvantage</strong>, as the attacker slips on the quiet you’ve already stepped into.</li></ul><p>Things start, but they rarely start <em>before</em> you’re ready.</p>",
